          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi mambo ganjina ga Selemani chigosala, kula mwandzo hata mwisho, gaandikpwa kpwenye chitabu cha kumbukumbu cha nabii Nathani na kpwenye unabii wa Ahija kula Shilo, na nabii Ido yeandika unabii kuhusu Jeroboamu mwana wa Nebati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Selemani watawala Iziraeli yosi kpwa miaka mirongo mine kula Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwisho, Selemani wafwa na achizikpwa vikurani pha akaree kahi za Mudzi wa Daudi. Mwanawe Rehoboamu achitawala badalaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.31"
            ]
          }
